  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Grant. You're verified. I checked the courier's records for order 8201. The courier's vehicle broke down after pickup, and the order was never handed over to anyone. The app's \"delivered\" status was an automatic update that was wrong.\n\nI've refunded the full amount you were charged, **$87.55**, to your Visa ending in 4242. That includes the fees and tip. It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\nI'm sorry about the cereal dinner. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for refunding the $87.55. That helps, but it doesn't really cover the mess. We had three hungry kids waiting, and the app told me it was delivered when nothing ever showed up. Is there anything extra you can do for us for the trouble?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry about the trouble, Grant. It was a bad night, and the app's wrong \"delivered\" status made it worse. But our policy doesn't allow extra credits or goodwill compensation beyond the refund for this kind of problem. The full $87.55 refund is what I can offer. An order that was never handed over isn't treated as a late delivery, so no late credit applies either.\n\nIf you'd like to talk to a person about this, I can pass your case to a human specialist, who would follow up within 24 hours. Would you like me to do that, or is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I get that the refund is what you can do. I'm not thrilled about it, since we still had no dinner, but I don't want to waste your time. Go ahead and pass it to a specialist, and I'll see if they can do anything more. Thanks for your help tonight."
  }
